{"id":"input-528fc8fa77bf","steamAppId":"2597080","name":"Realm of Ink","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597080/","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":8.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"8 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-528fc8fa77bf","canonicalId":"steam-app-2597080","suppliedName":"Realm of Ink","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Realm of Ink","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2026,"developers":["Leap Studio"],"publishers":["4Divinity"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"shortDescription":"Realm of Ink is an Ink-style action Roguelite game. While pursuing the Fox Demon, the swordswoman Red, unexpectedly finds that her life is dictated by the 'destiny' within the world of the book. Only by breaking free can she unveil the truth of her existence and challenge the constraints of fate.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"2597080"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597080/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:56:32.963Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:56:32.963Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"2597080","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597080/","officialWebsite":null,"support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":8,"unit":"GB","display":"8 GB","approximateBytes":8000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 8 GB"},"recommended":{"value":8,"unit":"GB","display":"8 GB","approximateBytes":8000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 8 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":13,"description":"Captions available"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"2597080","steamName":"Realm of Ink","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2597080/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:42:52.279988+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Realm of Ink is an Ink-style action Roguelite game. While pursuing the Fox Demon, the swordswoman Red, unexpectedly finds that her life is dictated by the 'destiny' within the world of the book. Only by breaking free can she unveil the truth of her existence and challenge the constraints of fate.","detailedDescription":"Join Our Community\n\nFollow our social media for the latest updates of Realm of Ink.\n\nAbout the Game\n\nStep into the shifting, treacherous realms as Red, the swordsman bound by her destiny. Wield the power of the Fox whilst confronting monstrous enemies and brutal bosses. Death is not the end; it's just a chance to redefine your destiny through cycles of death and rebirth. Take up your weapon and let your quest to escape the ever-changing realm of ink begin.\n\nExperience infinite creativity. Dive into thrilling, fast-paced combat and invent a style that is uniquely yours.\n\n• \nMix and match dozens of different forms, weapons, and enhancements.\n\n• \nWith over 40 distinctive Ink Gems, every single run is a new opportunity.\n\n• \nUnlock vast possibilities and enhance playstyles with over 200 artifacts\n\n• \nThink you’ve mastered the realm? Prove it. Push your skill to the absolute limit in the Trial Valleys and earn high scores in the brutal Endless Challenge mode.\n\nAdorable yet deadly. Meet Momo: your fiercely loyal companion. This mysterious Ink Pet fights tooth and claw alongside you every step of the way. But the real magic happens when you combine Ink Gems: witness instant, explosive transformations! Experience the unique changes with over 15 unique, striking forms, each one granting access to utterly unique move sets. Which combination will become your favourite?\n\nAn Eastern fantasy world, painted in ink.\n\nJourney deep into stunning, diverse realms, from the vibrant, verdant forests to the hallowed, reverent ruins of the Mausoleum. Each environment is a breathtaking blend of classical Chinese ink-wash art and rich, vibrant colour palettes.\n\nDraw your sword and venture into the unknown. Battle the enigmatic Realm Guardians to glimpse beyond the veil into their mysterious pasts. And prepare to face over 20 unique creatures, steeped in distinctive Chinese folklore and backstory, including the cunning Fox Demon, the elegant Peony Fairy and the elusive Mirror Sprite.","aboutGame":"Step into the shifting, treacherous realms as Red, the swordsman bound by her destiny. Wield the power of the Fox whilst confronting monstrous enemies and brutal bosses. Death is not the end; it's just a chance to redefine your destiny through cycles of death and rebirth. Take up your weapon and let your quest to escape the ever-changing realm of ink begin.\n\nExperience infinite creativity. Dive into thrilling, fast-paced combat and invent a style that is uniquely yours.\n\n• \nMix and match dozens of different forms, weapons, and enhancements.\n\n• \nWith over 40 distinctive Ink Gems, every single run is a new opportunity.\n\n• \nUnlock vast possibilities and enhance playstyles with over 200 artifacts\n\n• \nThink you’ve mastered the realm? Prove it. Push your skill to the absolute limit in the Trial Valleys and earn high scores in the brutal Endless Challenge mode.\n\nAdorable yet deadly. Meet Momo: your fiercely loyal companion. This mysterious Ink Pet fights tooth and claw alongside you every step of the way. But the real magic happens when you combine Ink Gems: witness instant, explosive transformations! Experience the unique changes with over 15 unique, striking forms, each one granting access to utterly unique move sets. Which combination will become your favourite?\n\nAn Eastern fantasy world, painted in ink.\n\nJourney deep into stunning, diverse realms, from the vibrant, verdant forests to the hallowed, reverent ruins of the Mausoleum. Each environment is a breathtaking blend of classical Chinese ink-wash art and rich, vibrant colour palettes.\n\nDraw your sword and venture into the unknown. Battle the enigmatic Realm Guardians to glimpse beyond the veil into their mysterious pasts. And prepare to face over 20 unique creatures, steeped in distinctive Chinese folklore and backstory, including the cunning Fox Demon, the elegant Peony Fairy and the elusive Mirror Sprite."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/e8946a403605c4981d38cdbbb8da27343f972cd7/header.jpg?t=1792048121"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/5e9eb71b2ac6f2e70752b4982c2a3d4f7b40f544/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792048121"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/849af4f3f941faa7abb7b5f70e202ead.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/13c0f4ccf2663d48549c448dcaec7c30.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/c991418ef6194fb5f7f58f4aca3eb579.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/b15ba5b58e2a2afd75a4172dae872c4c.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/69b2f217502b95a6f898b69af24ac1c3.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/522cda241b340bfc61208e13659074ba.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597080/extras/87fcee67b01bd77a90ebe1cc7a1c072f.avif?t=1792048121","alt":""},{"role":"desc